OL,3,GNEWSAPokemon cards are a currency now,
OL,4,Asays collector
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Pokemon card trader in a city has
OL,7,Fsaid the cards were a "currency now".
OL,9,F"People see them as an investment, a
OL,10,Fretirement fund or a way to secure
OL,11,Ftheir future," added Juliano Scibelli,
OL,12,F34, who runs Collectors Corner in Orton
OL,13,FSouthgate, Peterborough.
OL,15,FScibelli's comments come as Pokemon
OL,16,Fenthusiasts prepare to celebrate the
OL,17,FJapanese brand's 30th anniversary on
OL,18,FWednesday, with the release of a new
OL,19,Frange of cards.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
